{# ── Shared subpage shell (v4 landing design system) ─────────────────────────
   The ONE layout for every Resources + legal page (guides, vision, changelog,
   privacy, terms). Wraps page content in the v4 chrome: the shared landing
   navbar (nav.njk) + footer (footer.njk), the invite-code download gate, and
   the bone token layer (site-tokens + landing + subpage css).

   In-page nav/footer anchors (#multiplayer, #pricing, …) point at landing
   sections, so `root` prefixes them to "/#…"; on the landing itself `root` is
   unset (empty) and the anchors stay bare. `subpage` flags nav.njk to render
   its solid (non-hero) variant.

   Pages extend this and fill:
     block subpageStyles   — page-specific CSS (essay/legal/timeline layout)
     block subpageContent  — the <main> content #}
{% extends "base.njk" %}
{% set root = "/" %}
{% set subpage = true %}
{# Self-hosted Hanken Grotesk (via site-tokens) is the whole type system here,
   exactly like the landing — drop base.njk's render-blocking Fontshare request. #}

{% block headScripts %}
<script>document.documentElement.className += " js";</script>
{% endblock %}
{% block stylesheets %}
<link rel="preload" href="/assets/fonts/hanken-grotesk-latin.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/site-tokens.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/landing.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/subpage.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/download-gate.css">
{% block subpageStyles %}{% endblock %}
{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
{% include "landing/nav.njk" %}
<main id="main" class="subpage">
{% block subpageContent %}{% endblock %}
</main>
{% include "landing/footer.njk" %}
{% include "landing/download-modals.njk" %}
{% include "landing/subpage-scripts.njk" %}
{% endblock %}
